/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (A Git-CLI-Scanner is a command-line tool designed to scan Git repositories for potentially sensitive, private, or accidentally exposed information. It can help developers identify security issues before code is pushed or shared publicly.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
