/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (The Interception \(pre-commit hook\): Git finds our pre-commit hook \(installed via the git-cli-scanner init command\). Instead of completing the commit, Git executes the hook script which runs: npx git-cli-scanner scan --hook)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
138 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (The Analysis \(Scanning Staged Files\): The CLI tool wakes up and analyzes only the files that are currently staged for the commit. It processes these files through a multi-layered security engine:)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
