/P 366 0 R
/E (Vulnerabilities Found: The tool halts the process, prints a detailed report \(showing the exact file, line number, severity, and suggested fix\), and prompts the developer: ? Vulnerabilities were found! Do you still want to continue with the commit? \(y/N\))
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
